Apple today released a new beta of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-26/">macOS Tahoe</a> 26.6.2, which is available to developers and public beta testers. The &zwnj;macOS Tahoe&zwnj; 26.6.2 beta comes just a few days after Apple <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/06/apple-releases-macos-tahoe-26-6-1/">released macOS Tahoe 26.6.1</a>, a security update.<br/>
